    "Wheels / tyres": "700c (622). Clearance for 35-622 tyres with at least 4 mm all round (checked in 3D). Stock Hektor: 25-622.",
    "Rear hub": "135 mm OLD disc hub (6-bolt), fixed/flip-flop or singlespeed freewheel, 10 mm bolt-on or QR axle in sliding dropouts. Rear sprocket must sit at the chainline below.",
