    "Drivetrain": "Gates Carbon Drive CDX, 60T front, 22T (9-spline freewheel) or 21T (track thread fixed), 115T belt, chainline 50.0 mm.",
    "Frame split": "Required for belt: bolted splitter in drive-side seat stay (or split dropout).",
    "Bottom bracket": "BSA / English threaded 68 mm, external cups (stock: Hollow-Axle 170 mm cranks).",
    "Headset / fork": "ZS44/ZS56 tapered head tube; any 1 1/8\"-1.5\" tapered carbon fork, 380 mm A-C, 45 mm offset, 12 x 100 mm thru-axle, flat mount, 160 mm rotor, clearance for 35 mm tyres.",
    "Seatpost / clamp": "27.2 mm post; 31.8 mm external seat collar.",
    "Brakes": "Hydraulic disc. Rear: post mount, 160 mm rotor (on the non-drive slider), 160 mm rotor; caliper sits behind/above the axle and moves with the slider, so belt tensioning never needs a brake re-adjustment. Front: flat mount, 160 mm rotor on the fork.",
    "Hose routing": "Rear hose internal through top tube (6 mm ports 45 mm from each end, non-drive side), then along the non-drive seat stay on 2 x M4 guide bosses.",
